```astro
---
import Layout from '~/layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'SEO Article Writing';
const description =
  'Professionally researched, strategically optimized content that sounds like your brand — not like it came from a content mill.';
---

<Layout {title} {description}>
  <div class="announce">
    SEO content that earns attention — and deserves to rank.
    <span>Our writers research before they write.</span>
  </div>

  <nav class="nav">
    <div class="wrap navin">
      <a class="brand" href="#">
        <span class="mark"><i></i></span>
        AstroWindy
      </a>

      <div class="links">
        <a href="#why">Why us</a>
        <a href="#features">What you get</a>
        <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
        <a href="#proof">Results</a>
      </div>

      <a class="navcta" href="#pricing">View packages</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow hero-eyebrow">SEO article writing</div>

          <h1>
            Articles people want to read.
            Search engines want to rank.
          </h1>

          <p class="hero-lede">
            Professionally researched, strategically optimized content that
            sounds like your brand — not like it came from a content mill.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-note">
          <strong>Since 2006</strong>
          Writing useful content for businesses across industries and budgets.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="intro" id="why">
    <div class="wrap intro-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">The shift</div>
        <h2>Quality content is no longer optional.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="intro-copy">
        <p>
          We started writing articles for businesses back in 2006. The web has
          changed dramatically since then — and so has what it takes to build
          search visibility.
        </p>

        <p>
          Today, publishing another keyword-filled article isn't enough. Your
          content has to satisfy the searcher, demonstrate expertise and give
          people a reason to stay, trust you and take the next step.
        </p>

        <p>
          That's why we obsess over the fundamentals: research, intent,
          structure, clarity, originality and a voice that actually sounds
          human.
        </p>

        <div class="pull">
          Every article should earn its place on your website — not simply fill
          a publishing calendar.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features" id="features">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">What you get</div>
          <h2>A better article from first brief to final draft.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="desc">
          The visual system deliberately mixes open space with a few strong
          cards. The result feels more editorial and less like a grid of SaaS
          features.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="feature feature-accent">
          <div class="num">01 / RESEARCH</div>
          <h3>Highly focused</h3>
          <p>
            We tailor the topic, tone and depth around the audience you're
            actually trying to reach — and the intent behind the search.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature">
          <div class="num">02</div>
          <h3>Original</h3>
          <p>
            Every article is written from scratch and checked for originality
            before delivery.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature">
          <div class="num">03</div>
          <h3>Proofread</h3>
          <p>
            Clean structure, grammar and presentation — ready for your editor
            or CMS.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature">
          <div class="num">04 / SEO</div>
          <h3>Keyword-smart</h3>
          <p>
            Search terms are incorporated naturally, with headings, entities
            and internal opportunities considered as part of the brief.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature">
          <div class="num">05</div>
          <h3>Useful</h3>
          <p>
            Articles designed to answer real questions, demonstrate expertise
            and move readers toward action.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature">
          <div class="num">06</div>
          <h3>On-brand</h3>
          <p>
            Your subject matter, terminology and voice remain recognizably
            yours.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pricing" id="pricing">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="pricing-intro">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Pricing</div>
          <h2>Choose the level of content support you need.</h2>
        </div>

        <p>
          Start small or build a consistent publishing engine. Every package
          includes research, writing, editing and SEO thinking.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="plans">
        <article class="plan">
          <div class="price-top">
            <div>
              <div class="eyebrow">Starter</div>
              <h3>One article</h3>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="price">From $250</div>

          <p>
            A focused, professionally researched article for a specific topic
            or search opportunity.
          </p>

          <a class="btn" href="#contact">Get started →</a>
        </article>

        <article class="plan featured">
          <div class="price-top">
            <div>
              <div class="eyebrow">Popular</div>
              <h3>Content batch</h3>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="price">From $900</div>

          <p>
            A coordinated batch of articles built around your broader content
            and search strategy.
          </p>

          <a class="btn" href="#contact">Choose this →</a>
        </article>

        <article class="plan">
          <div class="price-top">
            <div>
              <div class="eyebrow">Ongoing</div>
              <h3>Content engine</h3>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="price">Let's talk</div>

          <p>
            Consistent monthly publishing with an evolving editorial and SEO
            workflow.
          </p>

          <a class="btn" href="#contact">Talk to us →</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="proof" id="proof">
    <div class="wrap proof-grid">
      <div class="proof-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">Results</div>
        <h2>Good content should make the rest of marketing easier.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="proof-grid-inner">
        <article class="testimonial">
          <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p>
            “The articles finally sound like someone who understands our
            business — not someone who just researched the keywords.”
          </p>
          <div class="person">
            Customer name<br />
            <span>SEO manager, company</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="testimonial">
          <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p>
            “The quality of the research made the editing process dramatically
            easier for our team.”
          </p>
          <div class="person">
            Customer name<br />
            <span>Marketing director, company</span>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta" id="contact">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cta-box">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow cta-eyebrow">Ready when you are</div>

          <h2>
            Give your content calendar something worth publishing.
          </h2>

          <p>
            Start with a sample, choose a package, or tell us what you're
            trying to rank for. We'll help shape the brief.
          </p>
        </div>

        <a class="btn" href="#pricing">Explore article packages →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="wrap footerin">
      <div>© AstroWindy · SEO Article Writing</div>

      <div class="mini-links">
        <a href="#">Services</a>
        <a href="#">Blog</a>
        <a href="#">About</a>
        <a href="#">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>

<style>
  :global(:root) {
    --ink: #111315;
    --muted: #656b73;
    --line: #e7e8eb;
    --paper: #fbfbfa;
    --soft: #f2f4f5;
    --accent: #0f6b5a;
    --accent2: #dff3ed;
    --dark: #111716;
    --max: 1180px;
  }

  :global(html) {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  :global(a) {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .wrap {
    width: min(calc(100% - 48px), var(--max));
    margin: auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  h3 {
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    line-height: 1.04;
    margin: 0;
  }

  p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .announce {
    height: 38px;
    background: #121514;
    color: #dfe7e3;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .announce span {
    opacity: 0.7;
    margin-left: 10px;
  }

  .nav {
    height: 78px;
    background: rgba(251, 251, 250, 0.92);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 20;
  }

  .navin {
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .mark {
    width: 27px;
    height: 27px;
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    transform: rotate(-8deg);
  }

  .mark i {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    display: block;
  }

  .links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #555b60;
  }

  .links a:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .navcta {
    padding: 11px 17px;
    border: 1px solid #cfd3d4;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .hero {
    min-height: 690px;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: #fff;
    background: #111716;
  }

  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        rgba(6, 13, 12, 0.9) 0%,
        rgba(6, 13, 12, 0.55) 55%,
        rgba(6, 13, 12, 0.2) 100%
      ),
      linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), transparent 60%);
  }

  .hero .wrap {
    position: relative;
    padding-top: 110px;
    padding-bottom: 78px;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 280px;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: end;
  }

  .hero-eyebrow {
    color: #a8d9ce;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(54px, 7vw, 92px);
    line-height: 0.96;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    max-width: 850px;
  }

  .hero-lede {
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 650px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
    margin-top: 30px;
  }

  .hero-note {
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    padding-left: 24px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .hero-note strong {
    display: block;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .intro,
  .features,
  .pricing,
  .proof {
    padding: 110px 0;
  }

  .intro {
    background: var(--paper);
  }

  .intro-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 110px;
  }

  .intro h2,
  .section-head h2,
  .pricing-intro h2,
  .proof-head h2 {
    font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 68px);
    margin-top: 18px;
  }

  .intro-copy {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .intro-copy p + p {
    margin-top: 22px;
  }

  .pull {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding: 25px 0 25px 25px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.35;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .features {
    background: var(--soft);
  }

  .section-head,
  .pricing-intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.7fr;
    gap: 90px;
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: 65px;
  }

  .desc,
  .pricing-intro > p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .feature {
    grid-column: span 4;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 34px;
    min-height: 260px;
  }

  .feature:nth-child(1),
  .feature:nth-child(4) {
    grid-column: span 6;
  }

  .feature-accent {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .num {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 55px;
  }

  .feature-accent .num {
    color: #a8d9ce;
  }

  .feature h3 {
    font-size: 29px;
    margin-bottom: 13px;
  }

  .feature p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .feature-accent p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
  }

  .plans {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .plan {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 35px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 360px;
    background: #fff;
  }

  .plan.featured {
    background: var(--accent2);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-14px);
  }

  .plan h3 {
    font-size: 30px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .price {
    font-size: 42px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    margin: 30px 0 15px;
  }

  .plan p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 14px 21px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: auto;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #fff;
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .proof {
    background: #fff;
  }

  .proof-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 90px;
  }

  .proof-grid-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .testimonial {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 30px;
  }

  .stars {
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  .testimonial p {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin: 22px 0 30px;
  }

  .person {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .person span {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .cta {
    background: var(--dark);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 110px 0;
  }

  .cta-box {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 70px;
    align-items: end;
  }

  .cta-eyebrow {
    color: #8ad0bf;
  }

  .cta h2 {
    font-size: clamp(44px, 5vw, 70px);
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }

  .cta p {
    color: #b8c3c0;
    font-size: 17px;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .cta .btn {
    background: #fff;
    color: #111;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .footer {
    padding: 45px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: #fff;
  }

  .footerin {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    color: #747b80;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .mini-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 22px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .links {
      display: none;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 600px;
    }

    .hero-grid,
    .intro-grid,
    .section-head,
    .pricing-intro,
    .proof-grid,
    .cta-box {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .hero-note {
      display: none;
    }

    .intro,
    .features,
    .pricing,
    .proof,
    .cta {
      padding: 90px 0;
    }

    .feature:nth-child(n) {
      grid-column: span 6;
    }

    .plans,
    .proof-grid-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .plan.featured {
      transform: none;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .wrap {
      width: min(calc(100% - 32px), var(--max));
    }

    .announce {
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .nav {
      height: 68px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 52px;
    }

    .feature:nth-child(n) {
      grid-column: span 12;
    }
  }
</style>
```
